{
  "_doc": [
    "Typed DetailsMaster request for xpp_create_form, shaped from a live read of a shipped DetailsMaster 1.4 form (EcoResInventTableItemIdRenameLog, 10.0.4x). Every pattern name, version and style below is what the metadata on disk carries.",
    "Pattern is DetailsMaster 1.4; the design STYLE is DetailsFormMaster (they diverge on purpose). Structure: ActionPane, a SidePanel Group (the navigation list: QuickFilter + List-style Grid), and a Tab with ShowTabs=No holding two pages: the DetailsPanel (title group + FastTabs of FieldsFieldGroups 1.1 pages) and the GridPanel (CustomAndQuickFilters 1.1 group + the main grid).",
    "The pattern engine stamps the prescribed property values at write time (including the sub-patterns' required values) and reports them under patternConformance; do not hand-set them.",
    "The title control binds dataMethod titleFields: on a sealed table author it as a FORM DATASOURCE display method with the base signature (Common _record) and cast inside.",
    "Substitute the backing table, fields and labels; keep the control kinds, styles and patterns."
  ],
  "name": "MyEntityDetails",
  "dataSources": [
    {
      "name": "MyEntity",
      "kind": "Root",
      "table": "MyEntity",
      "fields": [
        { "dataField": "MyEntityId" },
        { "dataField": "Name" },
        { "dataField": "Description" },
        { "dataField": "CreatedDateTime" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "design": {
